{"title":{"en":"Hornbeam Hedge","de":"Hainbuchenhecke"},"summary":{"en":"A clipped hornbeam hedge segment (Carpinus betulus) 3 m long and 1.8 m high: a dense, flat-topped, rectangular mass of foliage on six stem bundles; the lowest 0.35 m is open so the grey, slender stems and the planting strip show at large scale.","de":"Ein Abschnitt einer geschnittenen Hainbuchenhecke (Carpinus betulus) von 3 m Länge und 1,8 m Höhe: eine dichte, flach abgeschlossene, rechteckige Laubmasse auf sechs Stammbündeln; die untersten 0,35 m sind offen, sodass die grauen, schlanken Stämme und der Pflanzstreifen im großen Maßstab sichtbar sind."},"tags":["hedge","deciduous","broadleaf","clipped","wind","transpiration"],"provenance":{"author":"Semio staffage vegetation content worker","method":"handcrafted","created":"2026-10-29","references":[{"id":"wood-handbook-2021","citation":"Forest Products Laboratory (2021). Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material. General Technical Report FPL-GTR-282, USDA Forest Service. Chapter 5 (green density, modulus of elasticity and rupture; closest listed species used as proxy)."},{"id":"en-1991-1-4","citation":"EN 1991-1-4:2005 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-4: Wind actions. Air density 1.25 kg/m3, F = 0.5 rho cd A v^2, peak velocity pressure (1 + 7 Iv) q_m."},{"id":"en-1991-1-3","citation":"EN 1991-1-3:2003 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-3: Snow loads. Used for the order of magnitude of snow and ice accretion (about 10 kg/m2 on plan area)."},{"id":"vogel-1989","citation":"Vogel, S. (1989). Drag and reconfiguration of broad leaves in high winds. Journal of Experimental Botany 40(8), 941-948."},{"id":"koerner-1979","citation":"Koerner, C., Scheel, J. A. and Bauer, H. (1979). Maximum leaf diffusive conductance in vascular plants. Photosynthetica 13(1), 45-82."},{"id":"jones-2014","citation":"Jones, H. G. (2014). Plants and Microclimate, 3rd ed., Cambridge University Press. Leaf energy balance, leaf area index, boundary-layer conductance."},{"id":"monteith-unsworth-2013","citation":"Monteith, J. L. and Unsworth, M. H. (2013). Principles of Environmental Physics, 4th ed., Academic Press. Penman-Monteith leaf transpiration."}],"notes":{"en":"Six stem bundles carry six overlapping clipped foliage blocks; wind moves each block as a stiff panel with a small travelling phase along the row. Hornbeam keeps dry leaves through winter, which is why a clipped hedge keeps its screen function; a winter-bare geometry is not offered because shapes cannot be toggled by a pose. Poses are calm, fresh breeze, gale and snow on the clipped top.","de":"Sechs Stammbündel tragen sechs überlappende geschnittene Laubblöcke; der Wind bewegt jeden Block als steife Tafel mit kleiner wandernder Phase entlang der Reihe. Die Hainbuche behält trockenes Laub im Winter, weshalb eine geschnittene Hecke ihre Sichtschutzfunktion behält; eine winterkahle Geometrie wird nicht angeboten, da Formen durch eine Pose nicht ausgeblendet werden können. Posen sind Ruhe, frische Brise, Sturm und Schnee auf der geschnittenen Oberseite."}},"dimensions":{"heightM":1.85,"widthM":3.15,"depthM":0.7,"massKg":346},"materials":[{"id":"hornbeam-bark","title":{"en":"Smooth grey hornbeam bark","de":"Glatte graue Hainbuchenrinde"},"emissivity":0.94,"solarAbsorptivity":0.6,"densityKgM3":700,"conductivityWmK":0.13,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"hornbeam-leaf","title":{"en":"Hornbeam leaves in a clipped hedge face","de":"Hainbuchenblätter in der geschnittenen Heckenfläche"},"emissivity":0.97,"solarAbsorptivity":0.5,"source":"literature","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"hornbeam-wood","title":{"en":"Green hornbeam wood","de":"Frisches Hainbuchenholz"},"emissivity":0.9,"solarAbsorptivity":0.6,"densityKgM3":1000,"conductivityWmK":0.17,"elasticModulusPa":9000000000.0,"strengthPa":60000000.0,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"wood-handbook-2021"}],"poses":[{"id":"calm","title":{"en":"Calm summer day","de":"Windstiller Sommertag"},"description":{"en":"Light air of 1.5 m/s: the hedge stands upright and its six blocks form a straight clipped wall, drag per block 0.1 N.","de":"Leiser Zug von 1,5 m/s: Die Hecke steht aufrecht, ihre sechs Blöcke bilden eine gerade geschnittene Wand, der Widerstand je Block beträgt 0,1 N."},"bones":{},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpiration-a":0.8,"transpiration-b":0.8}},"loads":[{"id":"wind-block-1","kind":"wind","title":{"en":"Wind drag on clipped foliage block 1","de":"Winddruck auf Geschnittener Laubblock 1"},"bone":"block-1","x":0.73,"y":0,"fxN":0.1,"fyN":0,"source":"literature","reference":"en-1991-1-4"},
